# Lightwheel Enhancements: "Enchanted permanent gets +1/+1 and has vigilance." "Max speed — You may cast this card from
# your graveyard." (CR 702.178a, 113.6b) Bot1 casts it on an Ornithopter on turn 1 (speed 1, CR 704.5aa) and Bolts Bot2
# (speed 2, CR 702.179d); Bot2 Bolts the Ornithopter on turn 2, which puts the unattached Aura into the graveyard (CR
# 704.5m). On turn 3 another Bolt makes it speed 3 and the Aura is still refused from the graveyard with its {W} available
# and a legal Ornithopter to enchant; on turn 5 a third Bolt makes it speed 4 and Bot1 casts it from the graveyard onto that
# Ornithopter, which becomes a 1/3 with vigilance (an Ornithopter is a 0/2).

